<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The quest curtain (uiquest.py QuestCurtain and EventCurtain): the
	     letterbox bars a skinned quest dialog slides in, and the black and
	     white fades a quest script runs (FADE_OUT, FADE_IN, WHITE_OUT,
	     WHITE_IN). While the quest flag is on, nui_quest.QuestCurtain is
	     uiQuest.QuestDialog.QuestCurtain, the one curtain every dialog
	     shares, and this is its board (controller
	     assets/root/nui_quest_curtain.py). The bars are BarHeight pixels
	     tall, given in dp as bar_dp (0 at 16:9: then the curtain makes no
	     board for them); they slide by keyframe animations of their
	     transform. The fade layer is one element whose opacity animates in
	     one of four duration classes; it takes every press while it shows,
	     as legacy's CURTAIN bar is picked first. One format="none" timer
	     ends the slides and the fades on the NovaUI clock. The board stands
	     behind the quest dialog while only the bars show and in front of it
	     during a fade. It takes no focus. -->
	<title>quest-curtain</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="quest-curtain.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" class="nui-overlay quest-curtain" data-model="quest_curtain"
	data-style---quest-bar-height="bar_dp + 'dp'">
	<div id="quest-curtain-top" class="quest-curtain__bar quest-curtain__bar--top nui-anim"
		data-class-is-in="bars == 'in'" data-class-is-out="bars == 'out'"></div>
	<div id="quest-curtain-bottom" class="quest-curtain__bar quest-curtain__bar--bottom nui-anim"
		data-class-is-in="bars == 'in'" data-class-is-out="bars == 'out'"></div>
	<div id="quest-curtain-fade" class="quest-curtain__fade nui-anim nui-interactive" data-if="fade != ''"
		data-class-is-black="fade == 'black'" data-class-is-white="fade == 'white'" data-class-is-in="fade_dir == 'in'"
		data-class-is-out-fast="fade_dir == 'out' &amp;&amp; fade_class == 'fast'"
		data-class-is-out-normal="fade_dir == 'out' &amp;&amp; fade_class == 'normal'"
		data-class-is-out-slow="fade_dir == 'out' &amp;&amp; fade_class == 'slow'"
		data-class-is-out-slower="fade_dir == 'out' &amp;&amp; fade_class == 'slower'"
		data-class-is-in-fast="fade_dir == 'in' &amp;&amp; fade_class == 'fast'"
		data-class-is-in-normal="fade_dir == 'in' &amp;&amp; fade_class == 'normal'"
		data-class-is-in-slow="fade_dir == 'in' &amp;&amp; fade_class == 'slow'"
		data-class-is-in-slower="fade_dir == 'in' &amp;&amp; fade_class == 'slower'"></div>
	<nui-countdown id="quest-curtain-timer" format="none" data-if="timer_on" data-attr-end="timer_end_at"
		data-event-countdownend="timer_end()"/>
</body>
</rml>
